Subject: [PATCH] Validate V2 child headers against authenticated history and
 ASERT profile

Review correction: Validate V2 child headers against authenticated history and ASERT profile.

This isolated V2 candidate change preserves the existing Bitcoin parser and
mainnet parameters. Module tests do not establish lotusd block acceptance.
---
